    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12347919/comment/12558407",
          "id": "12558407",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Implementing this would mean deprecating Field.Store.COMPRESS and the various other places that use/set bits marking a field as compressed.\n\nSeems like a reasonable thing to do.  I will mark this as a 2.9 issue, so that we make sure we deprecate it at or before that time.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=gsingers",
            "name": "gsingers",
            "key": "gsingers",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2008-01-13T15:13:22.579+0000",
          "updated": "2008-01-13T15:13:22.579+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12347919/comment/12683145",
          "id": "12683145",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I added o.a.l.document.CompressionTools, with static methods to\ncompress & decompress, and deprecated Field.Store.COMPRESS.\n\nI also found two separate bugs:\n\n  * With Field.Store.COMPRESS we were running compression twice\n    (unnecessarily); I've fixed that.\n\n  * If you try to make a Field(byte[], int offset, int length,\n    Store.COMPRESS), you'll hit an AIOOBE.  I think we don't need to\n    fix this one since it's in now-deprecated code, and with 2.9,\n    users can migrate to CompressionTools.\n\nI plan to commit in a day or two.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-03-18T20:04:44.385+0000",
          "updated": "2009-03-18T20:04:44.385+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12347919/comment/12683962",
          "id": "12683962",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=uschindler",
            "name": "uschindler",
            "key": "thetaphi",
            "avatarUrls": {
